<div class="about-page">

  <section class="about-story section-padding">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-story__inner">
        <p class="about-eyebrow">About Brightfield</p>
        <h1 class="about-story__heading">Hi, I'm Eric.</h1>
        <div class="about-story__body">
          <p>I make wearable art from shader code.</p>
          <p>BrightField began when I started experimenting with WebGL fragment shaders and kept discovering visuals that felt too interesting to stay on a screen. I wanted to turn that process into something people could actually wear.</p>

          <p>Every design here starts as a real shader program — not stock art, not a preset, not a filtered graphic. Designs are ready to go just as they are, but I invite you to jump in, tweak the settings, and make them your own. You can customize the parameters, generate a preview, and create something that feels personal, playful, and unexpected.</p>

          <p>You don’t need to know anything about shaders or code to design your own shirt. You just need to be curious! ✨</p>

<p style="padding-top: 20px;">For information about printing, shipping, returns, etc, see our <a class="about-inline-link" href="/pages/faq">Frequently Asked Questions page</a>.</p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .about-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  /* Story */
  .about-story__inner {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .about-story__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .about-story__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-story__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-story__body code {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  /* Section heading shared */
  .about-section-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  /* Process */
  .about-process {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .about-process__steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .about-process__step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-process__number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .about-process__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-process__desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Values */
  .about-values__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-values__card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .about-values__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-values__desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-process__step {
      grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .about-inline-link {
  color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About",
  "presets": [
    { "name": "About" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
